B.bdH=new A.fo("c1","First Light","Power up with a Generator, bridge to a deposit with a Relay, then drop an Extractor on it. Mine 200.",0,1,200,0,260,1,16,900,640,B.Mm,4,"A Generator makes power; only RELAYS carry it onward. If a deposit is past the core's reach, drop a Relay to bridge the gap, then an Extractor on the rock to mine it.")
B.bdC=new A.fo("c2","Reaching Out","The ore is out of reach. Drop a Relay between the core and a far deposit, then mine 320.",0,1,320,0,240,7,16,1120,780,B.Mm,2,"Only RELAYS carry power onward \u2014 they are the bridges. The core is the heart; everything else (Generators, Cells, Extractors, turrets) just DRAWS from a Relay or the core in range. Chain Relays to reach far deposits, and upgrade a Relay to stretch its reach even farther.")
B.bdp=new A.fo("c3","The Long Line","Ore sits far out. Chain relays across the field and haul 480 minerals home.",0,1,480,0,240,15,24,1360,900,B.Mm,-1,"Long runs need several relays in a chain \u2014 each one hands power to the next. Plan the route before you spend on extractors.")
B.a2a=s([1,4,2,5],t.t)
B.bde=new A.fo("c4","First Contact","Raiders inbound. Ring the core with Lasers and hold 3 waves.",0,0,3,3,300,22,16,1120,780,B.a2a,5,"A Laser auto-fires at any raider in range \u2014 place a few around the core. Turrets need power too, so keep them wired to the grid.")
B.bdm=new A.fo("c5","Hard Cases","Breakers target your modules, not the core. Layer your Lasers and survive 4 waves.",0,0,4,4,320,30,18,1200,820,B.a2a,-1,"Breakers are slow and tough and chew your buildings. Put lasers where they can cover your extractors and each other.")
B.a9R=s([1,4,2,5,3],t.t)
B.bdA=new A.fo("c6","Prospector","Dig under harassment. Add a Cell so your guns never run dry, and mine 650.",0,1,650,0,280,38,22,1300,860,B.a9R,3,"A Cell banks spare power for busy moments. With a cell wired in, your lasers keep firing when a wave hits all at once.")
B.bdn=new A.fo("c7","Power Surge","Heavier waves now. Bank energy between waves and spend it holding 5 waves.",0,0,5,5,320,46,18,1200,820,B.a9R,-1,"A full cell is a buffer against a surge. Let it charge in the quiet, and your guns won't stutter when the wave lands.")
B.a8L=s([1,4,2,5,3,6],t.t)
B.bdq=new A.fo("c8","Swarm","Darts come in numbers. Add fast-firing Pulsers to shred the swarm and hold 5 waves.",0,0,5,5,340,54,18,1240,840,B.a8L,6,"A Pulser fires much faster than a laser \u2014 perfect for clouds of little darts. Mix pulsers in where the swarm is thickest.")
B.bda=new A.fo("c9","Deep Dig","Fund guns AND extractors at once. Keep the lode flowing and reach 1000.",0,1,1000,0,300,62,26,1380,920,B.a8L,-1,"Every mineral spent on a gun is one not spent on an extractor. Grow income first, then reinvest it into defence \u2014 and repeat.")
B.a3Y=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7],t.t)
B.bdF=new A.fo("c10","Cutting Beam","Fit a long-range Beam and let it burn. Mine 700 while it holds the field.",0,1,700,0,360,70,22,1300,860,B.a3Y,7,"The Beam is a continuous ray with long reach \u2014 it melts a target over time. It's power-hungry, so keep a Cell nearby.")
B.bdL=new A.fo("c11","Torus Packs","Torus ships shrug off beams. Fall back on Lasers and Pulsers and hold 6 waves.",0,0,6,6,360,78,18,1300,860,B.a3Y,-1,"A Torus barely feels your Beam \u2014 bullets do the work here. Keep lasers and pulsers ready for when the toruses roll in.")
B.h7=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8],t.t)
B.bdk=new A.fo("c12","Long Reach","Unlock the Lance \u2014 huge damage at long range. Mine 900 while lances cover you.",0,1,900,0,400,86,24,1420,940,B.h7,8,"Lances hit hard from far away \u2014 but not point-blank. Put them BEHIND your lasers so close-in raiders never reach them.")
B.bdE=new A.fo("c13","Frontier Lines","Spread out and defend the whole grid. Hold supply and guns across 6 waves.",0,0,6,6,380,94,26,1480,980,B.h7,-1,"A long supply line is a long thing to defend. Guard the relays and extractors out on the frontier, not only the core.")
B.bdD=new A.fo("c14","Last Redoubt","Cramped and exposed \u2014 no room to spread. Build a tight, layered fort and outlast 7 waves.",0,0,7,7,380,102,12,1000,720,B.h7,-1,"With no space to spread, stack your defences in layers: pulsers up front, lances and beams behind. Overlap their coverage.")
B.bdy=new A.fo("c15","Deep Vein","Strip a rich lode while torus packs press in. Guns up, extractors running \u2014 reach 1600.",0,1,1600,0,360,110,28,1460,960,B.h7,-1,"Toruses return every few waves \u2014 keep a wall of bullets standing, not just a beam. Your income has to outpace your repairs.")
B.bdr=new A.fo("c16","Siege","A Colossus leads the horde. Concentrate lances and heavy fire, and hold 8 waves.",0,0,8,8,440,118,22,1400,920,B.h7,-1,"The Colossus is slow but soaks enormous damage \u2014 focus lances and beams on it while lasers and pulsers clear its escort.")
B.bdf=new A.fo("c17","Hold the Vein","Mine deep while the threat peaks. Never stop producing \u2014 reach 2000.",0,1,2000,0,400,126,30,1500,1000,B.h7,-1,"A long dig will outlast several waves, boss included. Defend the extractors you have before you rush to build more.")
B.bdc=new A.fo("c18","The Long Haul","A vast field, everything at once. Hold supply and defence across 10 waves.",0,0,10,10,420,134,34,1580,1060,B.h7,-1,"Big maps mean many fronts and a big grid to power. Cells and relays keep distant guns fed \u2014 don't let an edge go dark.")
B.bdt=new A.fo("c19","Twin Veins","Two rich fields, two fronts to hold. Work both and reach 2600.",0,1,2600,0,420,142,32,1540,1020,B.h7,-1,"Two mining fronts double your income and your exposure. Give each its own ring of guns rather than one big pile in the middle.")
B.bdh=new A.fo("c20","Gauntlet","No soft waves left. Everything you have, holding the line for 12 waves.",0,0,12,12,460,150,24,1420,940,B.h7,-1,"From here on every wave bites. Repair and re-arm in the breathers and call the next wave early only when you're truly ready.")
B.bdz=new A.fo("c21","Lean Times","Little to start, ore far out, waves already hard. Mine your way up to 2200.",0,1,2200,0,240,158,28,1480,980,B.h7,-1,"A lean start punishes waste \u2014 sell what you misplace and reinvest. One good extractor, well defended, beats three you can't protect.")
B.bdb=new A.fo("c22","Citadel","Turn a small field into a fortress. Layer every weapon and hold 12 waves.",0,0,12,12,460,166,14,1040,740,B.h7,-1,"In a killbox, every shot should overlap. Front-line pulsers, mid lasers, back-line lances and beams \u2014 funnel them all through it.")
B.bdd=new A.fo("c23","Mother Lode","The richest seam in the field, and they want it too. Strip it for 3200.",0,1,3200,0,420,174,34,1560,1040,B.h7,-1,"At full tilt your income funds a moving front of guns. Push extractors outward as you clear space, and never let the grid brown out.")
B.bdw=new A.fo("c24","War of Attrition","A long, grinding siege \u2014 toruses and a boss both. Endure 14 waves.",0,0,14,14,480,182,26,1500,1000,B.h7,-1,"Endurance is economy: replace losses as fast as they fall. Keep a mineral cushion so a bad wave never leaves you unable to rebuild.")
B.bd6=new A.fo("c25","Double Trouble","Two Colossi across the siege, toruses between. Hold the core for 16 waves.",0,0,16,16,520,190,24,1440,960,B.h7,-1,"Two bosses means two moments everything must focus one target. Bank lances and energy ahead of each so you can burst it down.")
B.bdo=new A.fo("c26","Last Stand","Everything you have learned, all at once. Raise a fortress and survive 18 waves.",0,0,18,18,560,198,22,1360,920,B.h7,-1,"This is the exam \u2014 power, supply, and every weapon, together. Build deep, defend the tether, and focus the bosses. Good luck.")
B.bm5=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9],t.t)
B.bdu=new A.fo("c27","Chokepoint","Shape the field. Wall off the gaps to funnel raiders into your guns, and hold 8 waves.",0,0,8,8,480,206,20,1380,920,B.bm5,9,"A Wall costs almost nothing, needs no power, and drops instantly. It won't fire \u2014 it blocks and soaks, funneling enemies onto your turrets.")
B.bjO=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9,15],t.t)
B.bd8=new A.fo("c28","Locust Swarm","Swarmers arrive in clouds. Add spread-firing Flak Cannons to shred them and hold 9 waves.",0,0,9,9,500,214,20,1400,940,B.bjO,15,"A Flak Cannon throws three bolts at once \u2014 ideal against Swarmers, the tiny ships that come in packs. Put flak where the cloud is thickest.")
B.bjQ=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9,15,10],t.t)
B.bdg=new A.fo("c29","Force Multiplier","One Amplifier makes every nearby gun hit harder. Buff your defence and mine 2400.",0,1,2400,0,460,222,30,1520,1000,B.bjQ,10,"An Amplifier fires nothing itself \u2014 it boosts the damage and rate of turrets in its aura. Sit it in the middle of a gun cluster for the most lift.")
B.bEv=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9,15,10,11],t.t)
B.bdB=new A.fo("c30","Hold the Line","Torus packs hammer the front. Project a regenerating Shield over your guns and hold 10 waves.",0,0,10,10,540,230,22,1440,960,B.bEv,11,"A Shield Projector wraps nearby modules in a pool that absorbs damage and refills over time. Keep it powered, and your front line lasts far longer.")
B.bAM=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9,15,10,11,12],t.t)
B.bds=new A.fo("c31","Chain Reaction","Wire in a Tesla Coil \u2014 its lightning leaps between clustered ships. Mine 3000 under fire.",0,1,3000,0,500,238,32,1560,1040,B.bAM,12,"A Tesla Coil arcs from target to target, so it shines against tight packs like Swarmers. Team it with Flak to clear a cloud in a heartbeat.")
B.bGZ=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9,15,10,11,12,13],t.t)
B.bdi=new A.fo("c32","Molasses","Scouts race for the core. Lay an EMP slow-field to drag them into your fire, and hold 11 waves.",0,0,11,11,560,246,22,1460,980,B.bGZ,13,"An EMP Emitter deals no damage \u2014 it slows every enemy in its aura. Chill the fast Scouts as they close so your turrets get the shots they need.")
B.n1=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9,15,10,11,12,13,14],t.t)
B.bdv=new A.fo("c33","Eyes Open","A Radar sharpens every gun and unmasks what's coming. Shielded Cruisers lead the assault \u2014 hold 13 waves.",0,0,13,13,600,254,24,1500,1000,B.n1,14,"A Radar extends every turret's reach, reveals cloaked ships, and previews the next wave. Concentrate fire to strip a Cruiser's front shield, then the hull.")
B.bdl=new A.fo("c34","Ghosts in the Dark","Cloaking raiders slip past blind turrets. Keep a Radar lit to unmask them and hold 15 waves.",0,0,15,15,640,262,24,1520,1020,B.n1,-1,"Stealth ships cloak and your guns lose the lock \u2014 only a Radar reveals them. Build a second Radar so one loss doesn't leave you firing blind.")
B.bdI=new A.fo("c35","Fortress Foundry","Run a war economy behind walls, shields and amplifiers. Strip the lode for 4200.",0,1,4200,0,620,270,36,1600,1060,B.n1,-1,"Wall the extractors in, shield the guns, and drop an Amplifier at the core. A fortified front keeps producing while the enemy breaks on it.")
B.bdG=new A.fo("c36","Flattop","Carriers hatch darts as they come. Burst them down before they flood you \u2014 hold 17 waves.",0,0,17,17,680,278,26,1560,1040,B.n1,-1,"A Carrier keeps spawning darts until it dies, so focus it first \u2014 lances and a boosted Tesla end it quickly before the swarm builds.")
B.bdx=new A.fo("c37","Field Medic","Healers keep the horde on its feet. Burst through the heal instead of chipping, and hold 19 waves.",0,0,19,19,720,286,26,1580,1060,B.n1,-1,"A Healer mends nearby ships faster than a trickle of fire can kill them. Concentrate burst damage \u2014 Amplifier plus lances \u2014 to drop targets before they heal.")
B.bdJ=new A.fo("c38","The Deep Lode","Every foe in the field wants this seam. Run the full arsenal and strip it for 5200.",0,1,5200,0,700,294,38,1640,1100,B.n1,-1,"Swarmers, Scouts, Cruisers, Stealth, Carriers and Healers all press at once. Layer the answers \u2014 Flak and Tesla for packs, Radar for ghosts, focus-fire for the rest.")
B.bd9=new A.fo("c39","All Fronts","A vast field, the full bestiary, everything you own. Hold every front for 22 waves.",0,0,22,22,760,302,34,1680,1120,B.n1,-1,"Many fronts, many enemy types, one grid to power. Radar and Amplifier lift the whole line; walls and shields hold the edges while your guns do the work.")
B.bdK=new A.fo("c40","Tetherfield","Everything, all at once, to the bitter end. Raise the ultimate fortress and survive 30 waves.",0,0,30,30,900,310,28,1520,1020,B.n1,-1,"This is everything: every tool, every foe, both bosses and the whole swarm. Build deep, amplify and shield the line, unmask the ghosts, and hold. This is the field.")
B.MQ=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9,15,10,11,12,13,14,16],t.t)
B.aQY=new A.BU(1500,1080,400,!0,"c41","First Strike","A rival citadel squats across the field. Raise a Roost and let your fighters raze it.",0,4,1500,0,500,318,22,1200,800,B.MQ,16,"A Roost births fighters that march on the enemy base all by themselves \u2014 you never steer them. Each fighter costs minerals, so keep the Roost powered and the ore flowing.")
B.aQZ=new A.BU(2600,1120,410,!1,"c42","Crossfire","They raid while you besiege. Hold the line at home and keep the fighters marching.",0,4,2600,0,480,326,26,1240,820,B.MQ,-1,"Defend while you push: raids keep coming for the whole siege. Split your minerals between guns at home and fighters for the front \u2014 a dead economy loses both battles.")
B.aR_=new A.BU(4200,1160,430,!1,"c43","The Siege","The last citadel is a fortress and its raids run deep. Outproduce it and grind it to dust.",0,4,4200,0,520,334,28,1280,860,B.MQ,-1,"An Awakened (Mk III) Roost fields squads \u2014 two fighters at a time. Evolve your Roosts and overlap the stream; a thin trickle just breaks on the walls.")
