B.cTB=new A.q("logEntryColumn",B.u,"projdash-0810 fix-forward: opt-in boolean column stamped `true` on every entry this node CREATES (the compose/reply path) \u2014 marks it as log chatter rather than a first-class project item, so a host explorer node's matching `overviewLogColumn` can exclude it from the per-project Overview dashboard's counts. Pair the two props with the SAME column name. Unset (default) is a no-op: entries are written exactly as before this prop existed.",B.f,null)
