B.d4N=new A.q("excludeArchived",B.V,'dufb17a-0924: drop rows hidden by the ARCHIVE lifecycle (rows whose incoming edges are all type "archived", plus their contains-subtrees), read via the scope* edge keys. Scoped views already never reach them; this covers whole-table use. Absent/false = unchanged.',B.f,null)
