B.d0L=new A.q("subtitle",B.u,'Column shown as a muted subtitle. Also honored by `density:"row"` (wikipick-acceptfix-0831): set, the row tile grows from one line (44-52px) to two (58-68px) to fit it, ellipsized to one line; absent (default), the row stays exactly the single-line tile it always was.',B.f,null)
