B.d_L=new A.q("railResizable",B.V,"Opt-out (default true): a click-drag handle on the single rail's edge (wide layouts only) lets the user resize it live, between ~240dp and min(560dp, 50% of the available width); double-tap/ double-click resets to railWidth. The chosen width persists via the same explorerLayout LocalPrefs entry the two-level rail already uses.",B.f,null)
