B.d5l=new A.q("overviewMarkerColumns",B.jz,"projectOverview: boolean columns (e.g. bottleneck/blocked) whose true value marks an item as needing attention in the overview's \"Needs attention\" section \u2014 one group per configured column, titled by that column's own schema label. Empty (default) adds no marker groups; the no-responsible-person and stale groups are always generic and still show.",B.f,null)
