B.cDa=new A.d2("richdoc","A true WYSIWYG rich-text editor (flutter_quill) for one row's column \u2014 toolbar formatting (bold/italic/underline/strike/highlight/colour/font/headings/lists/links) stored as Quill Delta JSON. Migrates an existing Markdown value in on first open. The Docs page editor; Notes stay on `notepad`/Markdown.",B.beq,!1)
